{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8KkhSgDfMrAm76DweuXnIA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:25.884711+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8KkhSgDfMrAm76DweuXnIA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pEmwvrI2S6YBJjHesKms5BYCFO8xIia4l9MJbKYz4sb930I0fKeCNwxKkac3YibU9dVBicGMySM9DsgTibN3DXZLmjSqYNCyic56RwjdIMtqgQUk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南方科技大学生物医学工程系竭诚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我校攻读研究生（推免硕士生、直博生），学校将提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！请符合申请条件的申请人（包括南方科技大学本校生）登录南方科技大学研究生招生报考服务系统填报信息。</span></p><p><span>系统地址：</span></p><p><span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/logon</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>现就有关申请方式及注意事项通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3、已在本科院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>4、身体健康状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>5、学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的分析问题、解决问题的能力和较强的创新意识。</span></p><p><span>6、诚实守信，学风端正，无未解除的处分记录。</span></p><p><span>7、教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></p><p><span>8、本科专业背景包括且不限于生物医学工程专业，专业为生物、材料、化学、物理、机械、电子、药学、光学工程、计算机等相关领域的同学均欢迎报名参加。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟招收专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 083100 生物医学工程（学硕、学博）</span></p><p><span>2. 086000生物与医药（专硕）</span></p><p><span>3. 085400 电子信息（专硕）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>预报名系统中的招生专业供参考，最终录取学科以院系预选拔结果及全国推免服务系统中录取确认为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>推免预报名时间：</span></p><p><span>7月29日00:00 - 9月20日23:59</span></p><p><span>我系将于2026年9月分批次进行预推免线上面试。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>预报名方式：登录南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm. sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用 chrome、360 浏览器），点击“预推免报名”进行在线报名，接收可取得推免资格的校内外推免生预报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。需填报不超过3个意向报考导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）南科大推免预报名系统报名后下载打印“南方科技大学推免预报名申请表”；</span></p><p><span>（2）学校教务部门或所在院系盖章的大学本科阶段成绩单；</span></p><p><span>（3）本人有效身份证和学生证复印件（验原件）；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语六级或四级成绩证明、其他外语能力证明材料（提供复印件、验原件）；</span></p><p><span>（5）如有校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文等材料（提供复印件、验原件）；</span></p><p><span>（7）个人英文简历（1页）；</span></p><p><span>如申请人填写或提供的材料不真实，一经发现即取消其预录取资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>可招生导师列表详见官网：</span></p><p><span>https://bme.sustech.edu.cn/people/faculty/</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>考试安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>预推免考核暂定以线上方式举行，时间预计9月中上旬。</span></p><p><span>第一批次审核：8月31日完成报名的学生</span></p><p><span>第二批次审核：9月15日完成报名的学生</span></p><p><span>名额有限，请尽早提交报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>具体安排以最终公布为准，请持续关注相关通知。申请截止后，我院招生审核工作小组将对申请材料进行审核。通过资格审核者将以电话或邮件等方式通知，未通过者不作另外通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>请优先以“预推免咨询”为邮件主题发送给：</span></p><p><span>bmezb@sustech.edu.cn或致电0755-88011290, 赵老师</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>或加入南科大生医工系研招QQ群：1082050589（备注姓名+学校）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>更多招生导师相关信息请关注南方科技大学生物医学工程系网站：</span></p><p><span>https://bme.sustech.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section>